@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "<<class>>\nProcessor" as Processor
participant "shop:Inventory" as Inventory
participant "order:Order" as Order

[-> Processor : process(...)
activate Processor
Processor -> Inventory : getOrders()
activate Inventory
Inventory --> Processor : orders
deactivate Inventory
note over Processor, Inventory
    Validate the order number
    and select order 1.
end note

Processor -> Order : approve()
activate Order
note right of Order
    WAITING_APPROVAL becomes
    WAITING_FOR_DELIVERY.
    Other states are rejected.
end note
Order --> Processor : return
deactivate Order
note over Processor, Order
    Stock and the order's item are unchanged.
end note
[<-- Processor : success Result
deactivate Processor
@enduml
